        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/places> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/temporal> ;
    gmeow:sliceConsumer "Inscription readings and find contexts; the languages stress corpus."@x-gmeow-english.
